<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1832363905"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1556788464"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Door"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="高橋李依"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TVアニメ「Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活」キャラクターソングアルバム"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:58.647"><div begin="00:27.316" end="04:33.136"><p begin="00:27.316" end="00:31.612" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">冷たく乾いた風に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冰冷干燥的风吹拂银色发丝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu me ta ku ka wa i ta ka ze ni fu ka re ta gi n i ro</span></p><p begin="00:32.638" end="00:35.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">吹かれた 銀色<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被吹来的一缕银色</span></p><p begin="00:40.026" end="00:44.272" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">いつかの氷の記憶<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀抱着曾几何时冰封的记忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka no ko o ri no ki o ku</span></p><p begin="00:45.202" end="00:50.671" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">抱えて 歩き出した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈步向前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ka e te a ru ki da shi ta</span></p><p begin="00:51.669" end="00:53.893" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">行く先は遠く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">路途还很遥远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ku sa ki wa to o ku</span></p><p begin="00:54.935" end="00:56.805" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">旅路は険しく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">旅途满是艰险</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta bi ji wa ke wa shi ku</span></p><p begin="00:58.057" end="01:02.873" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">それでも心の灯は消えずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此心中的灯火也不会消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo ko ko ro no hi wa ki e zu ni</span></p><p begin="01:03.834" end="01:06.459" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">確かに手にした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">切实握于掌心的羁绊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta shi ka ni te ni shi ta ki zu na ga</span></p><p begin="01:07.509" end="01:09.432" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">絆が いつしか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天会化作勇气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu shi ka yu u ki ni ka wa ru</span></p><p begin="01:10.514" end="01:14.035" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">勇気に変わる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">化作了无限的勇气</span></p><p begin="01:15.819" end="01:16.773" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">さぁ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa</span></p><p begin="01:16.986" end="01:19.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">扉を開いていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去推开门扉吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi ra wo hi ra i te i ko u</span></p><p begin="01:19.606" end="01:22.426" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">未来を描いていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去描绘未来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i wo e ga i te i ko u</span></p><p begin="01:23.184" end="01:27.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">どんな運命が待っていようと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论怎样的命运在前方等待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na u n me i ga ma 't te i yo u to</span></p><p begin="01:29.685" end="01:34.499" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">あの日の約束 ギュッと握りしめ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也会始终紧握着那日的约定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no hi no ya ku so ku gyu 't to ni gi ri shi me</span></p><p begin="01:35.566" end="01:42.365" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">今 明日へ踏み出していこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在便向着明天踏出脚步吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma a shi ta he fu mi da shi te i ko u</span></p><p begin="01:55.937" end="02:01.899" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">長い間 孤独だった過去は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾长期处在孤独中的过去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ga i a i da ko do ku da 't ta ka ko wa</span></p><p begin="02:02.283" end="02:05.478" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">いつからか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知何时起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ra ka</span></p><p begin="02:08.575" end="02:12.837" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">扉の端 引っかかって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勾在了门框上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi ra no ha shi hi 'k ka ka 't te</span></p><p begin="02:13.496" end="02:18.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">開けるのを邪魔していた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阻碍着我推开门扉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ke ru no wo ja ma shi te i ta</span></p><p begin="02:20.022" end="02:22.044" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">それでも 今まで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便如此 时至如今</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo i ma ma de</span></p><p begin="02:23.362" end="02:25.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">重ねた出会いや<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所累积的一次又一次相遇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka sa ne ta de a i ya</span></p><p begin="02:26.706" end="02:31.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">もらった言葉が 教えてくれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与收获的话语 都让我明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo ra 't ta ko to ba ga o shi e te ku re ta</span></p><p begin="02:32.775" end="02:34.781" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">あきらめなければ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要不放弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ki ra me na ke re ba</span></p><p begin="02:35.992" end="02:37.732" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">たやすく希望は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望就不会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ya su ku ki bo u wa</span></p><p begin="02:38.886" end="02:42.529" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">消えたりしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻易地消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e ta ri shi na i</span></p><p begin="02:44.116" end="02:45.055" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">さぁ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa</span></p><p begin="02:45.449" end="02:47.992" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">扉を開いていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去推开门扉吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi ra wo hi ra i te i ko u</span></p><p begin="02:48.423" end="02:51.008" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">光を掴みにいこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去抓住光芒吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka ri wo tsu ka mi ni i ko u</span></p><p begin="02:51.512" end="02:56.012" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">決して折れない強い心で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀抱着永不屈服的强大内心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke 's shi te o re na i tsu yo i ko ko ro de</span></p><p begin="02:58.166" end="03:03.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">どんな過去だって全部受け止めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论怎样的过去都尽数接受</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na ka ko da 't te ze n bu u ke to me te</span></p><p begin="03:03.875" end="03:11.127" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">なお 前だけを見ていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次 只目视着前方前进吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na o ma e da ke wo mi te i ko u</span></p><p begin="03:14.468" end="03:17.344" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">この先 何があっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论将来会发生些什么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no sa ki na ni ga a 't te mo</span></p><p begin="03:20.824" end="03:23.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">信じられるものを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿属于自己的信赖之物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji ra re ru mo no wo</span></p><p begin="03:27.124" end="03:29.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">必ず自分の手で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">定能由我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na ra zu ji bu n no te de</span></p><p begin="03:32.604" end="03:36.298" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">見つけ出せるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲手找到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi tsu ke da se ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:41.761" end="03:44.724" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">たとえ風が吹こうと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使狂风肆虐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e ka ze ga fu ko u to</span></p><p begin="03:45.293" end="03:47.917" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">たとえ雪が降ろうと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使大雪飘飞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e yu ki ga fu ro u to</span></p><p begin="03:48.425" end="03:52.532" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">胸を張って咲く花のように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也要如同凛然绽放的花朵一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne wo ha 't te sa ku ha na no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:54.943" end="04:01.607" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">いつも力強く生きてゆけるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿永远都能够坚强地生活下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo chi ka ra zu yo ku i ki te yu ke ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="04:05.805" end="04:06.995" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra</span></p><p begin="04:07.537" end="04:10.121" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">扉を開いていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去推开门扉吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to bi ra wo hi ra i te i ko u</span></p><p begin="04:10.478" end="04:13.147" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">未来を描いていこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去描绘未来吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i wo e ga i te i ko u</span></p><p begin="04:13.681" end="04:17.934" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">どんな運命が待っていようと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论怎样的命运在前方等待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na u n me i ga ma 't te i yo u to</span></p><p begin="04:20.194" end="04:25.186" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">絶対 変わらない思いを胸に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也要怀抱着永恒不变的信念</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze 't ta i ka wa ra na i o mo i wo mu ne ni</span></p><p begin="04:25.964" end="04:33.136" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">今 明日へ踏み出していこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在便向着明天踏出脚步吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma a shi ta he fu mi da shi te i ko u</span></p></div></body></tt>